WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:08.996
Jane and Pip look out from the rock.

2
00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:17.289
Big slime monsters slide down the road.

3
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:22.525
"I think they're looking for us," Pip says.

4
00:00:22.526 --> 00:00:51.856
"Quiet," Jane says.

5
00:00:51.857 --> 00:01:02.849
Soon the monsters are out of sight.

6
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.349
Pip points to the right.

7
00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.299
"The monsters took that road to Gummy Grove.

8
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.752
There's a trail of icky goo."

9
00:01:12.753 --> 00:01:17.412
"The left road goes there too," Jane says.

10
00:01:17.413 --> 00:01:21.629
"But it's not as quick."

11
00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:33.897
"Let's go left to be safe," Pip says.

12
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:39.608
The wide road becomes a thin path.

13
00:01:39.609 --> 00:01:44.391
Soon the kids are in the woods.

14
00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:54.071
Black vines hang, and a cool wind blows.

15
00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:59.320
"I wish I had boots," Pip says.

16
00:01:59.321 --> 00:02:16.261
"The path is squishy!"

17
00:02:16.262 --> 00:02:20.587
"Maybe it's made of food," Jane says.

18
00:02:20.588 --> 00:02:30.442
Pip takes a bite. "It is candy.

19
00:02:30.443 --> 00:02:47.501
But it's not good candy! Yuck!"

20
00:02:47.502 --> 00:02:52.473
"This place is spooky," Jane says.

21
00:02:52.474 --> 00:02:58.727
"I think so too," Pip says.

22
00:02:58.728 --> 00:03:04.430
"I see creepy shadows in the trees."

23
00:03:04.431 --> 00:03:07.238
Jane stops and looks.

24
00:03:07.239 --> 00:03:11.340
Shadows slide quickly in the trees.

25
00:03:11.341 --> 00:03:20.398
"Uh-oh," Jane says. "We're not alone."

